Package: effectagram
Title: Cross-Generalized Effect Geometry
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Bradley", "Buchsbaum", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "bradley.buchsbaum@gmail.com")
Description: Compiles fixed experimental-neural relations, identified neural
    measurements, and partition pairings into cross-generalized effect and
    measurement forms. Spatial node effects and cross-node coupling are the
    diagonal and off-diagonal blocks of one evidence operator. The package
    preserves explicit axes, capability-gated covariance interpretations,
    ordered normalization stages, and deterministic sequential execution.
